    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Isle of Harvest</strong>, a charming farming simulation and adventure game set on a lush, mysterious island. As the newest arrival to this remote paradise, you'll build a thriving farm and discover new and exciting crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins with a rundown plot of land and a heart full of dreams. Transform your surroundings,  shape your story in this beautifully handcrafted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Legacy:</strong> Cultivate diverse crops to build a flourishing farm.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Customize:</strong> Design your dream farm with crafted items, decorations, and upgrades.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Activities:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy the stunning vistas of the island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of endless possibilities where every choice shapes your journey. Whether you're seeking relaxation or adventure, <strong>Isle of Harvest</strong> offers an experience you won\u2019t forget.</p>",
